Subject: [PATCH] Eturlia: NeoForge no-arg updateFluidHeightAndDoFluidPushing
 for Sable

Sable @Overwrite targets the NeoForge no-arg fluid push method. Add it,
delegate TagKey overload like NeoForge, expose FluidState.getFluidType,
and isInFluidType(FluidType).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
